  'Upload file export member dari game (.csv atau .xlsx). Kolom yang dikenali: Player, Lv., Class, Title, Gender, Position, Gear Score, Weekly, Weekly Contribution, Total Contribution, Online Status. Member dicocokkan berdasarkan': ['Unggah file ekspor anggota dari game (.csv atau .xlsx). Kolom yang dikenali: Player, Lv., Class, Title, Gender, Position, Gear Score, Weekly, Weekly Contribution, Total Contribution, Online Status. Anggota dicocokkan berdasarkan', 'Muat naik fail eksport ahli dari permainan (.csv atau .xlsx). Lajur yang dikenali: Player, Lv., Class, Title, Gender, Position, Gear Score, Weekly, Weekly Contribution, Total Contribution, Online Status. Ahli dipadankan berdasarkan', 'Upload the member export from the game (.csv or .xlsx). Recognised columns: Player, Lv., Class, Title, Gender, Position, Gear Score, Weekly, Weekly Contribution, Total Contribution, Online Status. Members are matched by', 'อัปโหลดไฟล์สมาชิกที่ส่งออกจากเกม (.csv หรือ .xlsx) คอลัมน์ที่รองรับ: Player, Lv., Class, Title, Gender, Position, Gear Score, Weekly, Weekly Contribution, Total Contribution, Online Status จับคู่สมาชิกด้วย', 'Mag-upload ng member export mula sa laro (.csv o .xlsx). Kinikilalang column: Player, Lv., Class, Title, Gender, Position, Gear Score, Weekly, Weekly Contribution, Total Contribution, Online Status. Itinutugma ang miyembro batay sa'],
